top_prompts.prompt:
Convert this imperative-style OCaml to a purely functional version:
```ocaml
let count_chars s =
  let tbl = Hashtbl.create 26 in
  String.iter (fun c ->
    let n = try Hashtbl.find tbl c with Not_found -> 0 in
    Hashtbl.replace tbl c (n + 1)
  ) s;
  tbl
```

